@base = http://localhost:18080/api

### 登录。IDEA / VS Code REST Client 可执行；复制响应 token 到下面变量。
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"Learn@123456"}

### 将上一响应的 data.token 复制到此处，不要提交真实凭据。
@token = paste-demo-token-here

### 查看当前身份与权限
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 客户查询
GET {{base}}/customers?page=1&size=10&keyword=张
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看账户
GET {{base}}/accounts?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 重复执行会复用同一业务号；改变金额前需改变幂等键。
POST {{base}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: lesson-transfer-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"sourceId":"A1001","targetId":"A1002","amount":"100.00","channel":"INSTANT","remark":"第一次转账课程"}

### 查看转出流水
GET {{base}}/accounts/A1001/entries?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看通知
GET {{base}}/notifications?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看操作审计
GET {{base}}/audits?page=1&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 登出后原令牌立即失效
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
